# `kernels` renders WGSL without requiring a GPU (per `anneal help kernels`).

anneal kernels mlp
stdout 'kernels: mlp'
stdout 'device: webgpu'
stdout '@compute'
stdout 'fn main'
stdout '--- kernel 0 ---'
! stderr .

# Missing model name lists the available models and exits non-zero.
! anneal kernels
stdout 'usage: anneal kernels'
stdout 'available models:'
